- content_for(:hide_nav_search, true)

:css
	article.static p, li {
		opacity: 0.8;
		font-size: 17px;
	}

.contain.contain--yield
	%article.static{class: '!pb-0'}
		.contain--extra-small
			.flex-center.mb-4
				%span.bg-surface.text-secondary.py-1.px-3.rounded-lg The story of Tomes
			.mb-8
				%h1.font-semibold.max-w-xl{class: 'text-[44px] leading-[1.1] text-center mx-auto'} Classic literature shouldn't feel like a museum piece.
			%p= description "The classics shouldn't just sit on dusty shelves or live in clunky, outdated archives. Tomes breathes new life into public domain works by providing a modern, beautiful, and social reading space."
			%p 
				%span Literature is a conversation that spans centuries. We built 
				%strong tomes.club
				%span to give readers a space where they can rediscover historical masterpieces and share their thoughts with a community of fellow book lovers.
			-# %p Tomes is currently in its early stages, focusing on the core essentials of a digital library:
			-# %p.flex.gap-2
			-# 	%i.ph.ph-check-circle.pt-1
			-# 	%span Explore the Classics: Browse a growing collection of works that have shaped human history.

			-# %p.flex.gap-2
			-# 	%i.ph.ph-check-circle.pt-1
			-# 	%span Share Your Voice: Write reviews to help others navigate the vast world of public domain literature.

			-# %p.flex.gap-2
			-# 	%i.ph.ph-check-circle.pt-1
			-# 	%span Build Your Circle: Follow other readers with similar tastes and invite your friends to join the journey.
			%p We focus on:
		%div{class: 'max-w-[900px] w-full mx-auto my-9'}
			.grid.grid-cols-3.gap-5
				.bg-surface.p-6.rounded-xl
					%i.ph.text-3xl.ph-person-simple-circle{class: 'block mb-4'}
					%h3{class: '!mt-0 !mb-4'} Accessibility
					%p{class: '!mb-0'} Making timeless literature free and easy to read.
				.bg-surface.p-6.rounded-xl
					%i.ph.text-3xl.ph-users-three{class: 'block mb-4'}
					%h3{class: '!mt-0 !mb-4'} Community
					%p{class: '!mb-0'} Connecting readers through reviews, follows, and shared discoveries
				.bg-surface.p-6.rounded-xl
					%i.ph.text-3xl.ph-eyes{class: 'block mb-4'}
					%h3{class: '!mt-0 !mb-4'} Simplicity
					%p{class: '!mb-0'} A clean, distraction-free environment that puts the focus back on the prose.
		.contain--extra-small
			%p Tomes is currently in its early stages, focusing on the core essentials of a digital library. It offers you a library with which you can explore the classics; a platform to share your voice; and a way to build your circle of book-reading friends.
			%h3 Join the club
			%p Whether you're a lifelong fan of the Brontës or just looking for your next great read, there's a place for you here.
			%p 
				%span Happy reading,
				%br/
				%i The Tomes Team.
				

.contain
	- if user_signed_in?
		=	render 'partials/footers/bottom'